{"id":"97562bc4aa1d6014","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-cfg-generated-language.md","title":"Language Generated by a Context-Free Grammar","display":"df-context-free-grammar-language — Language Generated by a Context-Free Grammar","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-cfg-generated-language","aliases":["73-df-cfg-generated-language","73-df-context-free-grammar-language"],"display":"df-context-free-grammar-language — Language Generated by a Context-Free Grammar","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-derivation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-cfg-generated-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-cfg-generated-language</span><span>73-df-context-free-grammar-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-context-free-grammar-language — Language Generated by a Context-Free Grammar"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76137a7886cfb97a\" href=\"?note=76137a7886cfb97a\" title=\"73-df-cfg-derivation\">73-df-cfg-derivation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (context-free grammar)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_G^*\">\\(\\Rightarrow_G^*\\)</span> (derivation closure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76137a7886cfb97a\" href=\"?note=76137a7886cfb97a\" title=\"73-df-cfg-derivation\">73-df-cfg-derivation</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL(G)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:S\\Rightarrow_G^*w\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL(G)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:S\\Rightarrow_G^*w\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Requiring <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span> excludes sentential forms that still contain nonterminals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"76137a7886cfb97a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"76137a7886cfb97a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Rightarrow_G^*$ (derivation closure, see [[73-df-cfg-derivation]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_G^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL(G)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:S\\Rightarrow_G^*w\\}","display":true},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false}],"bytes":843,"backlinks":[{"id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L(G)$ (language generated by a grammar, see [[73-df-cfg-generated-language]])"}],"outgoing":["76137a7886cfb97a"]}